jevora-9b-v1 uses Qwen/Qwen3.5-9B at revision
ef3d031a90d340a92d71f83ec17d054e100ce713 as its upstream base model.

The upstream model card declares Apache-2.0. Qwen's license and notices remain
applicable to the upstream base model, tokenizer and configuration.

Project changes include a compact 255-way decision head, rank-64 LoRA adaptation of
the frozen backbone, training of the head, explicit uncalibrated temperature 1, and
the custom package/inference loader. Project code and derivative weights are
